OL,3,GNEWSAThe musicians behind the acts
OL,4,Aplaying world-famous stages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey play to tens of thousands of
OL,7,Fpeople on the world's biggest stages,
OL,8,Fbut most of us do not know their names.
OL,10,FSession musicians are fundamental to
OL,11,Fmany artists' set up, providing the
OL,12,Finstrumentals in studio recordings or
OL,13,Fat live performances, sometimes
OL,14,Fbecoming members of the band.
OL,16,FFor these performers, who have all
OL,17,Fgraced Glastonbury's Pyramid Stage
OL,18,Falongside acts like Little Simz, Kelis
OL,19,Fand Kasabian, it was Bristol that
OL,20,Fhelped nurture their talent, due to its
OL,21,Fsupportive and "no-pressure" attitude.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
